[00:21.02]1. We praise you, Jehovah, deep from our hearts,
[00:27.50]For in your Word we find
[00:34.38]Your power supreme, your wisdom so great,
[00:41.26]And yet you are loving and kind.
[00:48.57]2. Your Son still invites those bruised by the world
[00:54.93]To leave their cares behind.
[01:01.27]How kindly his yoke, how tender his heart,
[01:08.37]He’s always refreshing and kind.
[01:43.29]3. We see in our God and Jesus our Lord,
[01:56.29]The persons we should be.
[02:01.29]The power of kindness we can possess.
[02:06.29]With kindness, how strong we can be!